---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Privacy Policy for Blooming Systems Inc."
>
  <main>
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-container">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-intro">
          This Privacy Policy explains how Blooming Systems Inc. collects,
          uses, and protects information provided through this website.
        </p>
        <p class="effective-date">Effective Date: September 27, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-content">
      <div class="legal-layout">
        <aside class="legal-nav" aria-label="Privacy Policy sections">
          <span>CONTENTS</span>
          <a href="#introduction">Introduction</a>
          <a href="#information-we-collect">Information We Collect</a>
          <a href="#how-we-use">How We Use Information</a>
          <a href="#sharing">How We Share Information</a>
          <a href="#security">Data Security</a>
          <a href="#retention">Data Retention</a>
          <a href="#rights">Your Privacy Rights</a>
          <a href="#children">Children's Privacy</a>
          <a href="#changes">Changes</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </aside>

        <article class="legal-body">
          <section id="introduction">
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>
              Blooming Systems Inc. ("Blooming Systems," "we," "us," or "our")
              respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy describes the types
              of information that may be collected when you visit
              <strong> bloomingsys.com</strong> or contact us through the
              website, how that information may be used, and the choices
              available to you.
            </p>
            <p>
              This policy applies to information collected through this
              website and does not necessarily apply to information collected
              through other services, applications, or business relationships
              unless expressly stated.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="information-we-collect">
            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

            <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
            <p>
              You may voluntarily provide information when you contact
              Blooming Systems through the website. Depending on the nature
              of your inquiry, this may include your name, email address,
              company name, telephone number, the service or area of interest,
              and the contents of your message.
            </p>

            <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
            <p>
              When you visit a website, certain technical information may be
              made available to the website or its hosting infrastructure.
              Depending on the configuration of the website and hosting
              services, this may include information such as IP address,
              browser type, device information, referring pages, and basic
              usage information.
            </p>

            <p>
              We do not use this policy to represent that a particular
              analytics, advertising, or tracking technology is active on the
              website unless it has actually been implemented.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="how-we-use">
            <h2>How We Use Information</h2>

            <p>
              Information submitted through the website may be used to:
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Respond to inquiries and requests.</li>
              <li>Communicate with prospective or existing clients.</li>
              <li>Understand the services or information requested.</li>
              <li>Provide and improve our website and services.</li>
              <li>Maintain the security and integrity of the website.</li>
              <li>
                Comply with applicable legal, regulatory, or contractual
                requirements.
              </li>
            </ul>

            <p>
              We do not use information submitted through the contact form for
              purposes unrelated to the inquiry without an appropriate legal
              basis or other applicable authorization.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="sharing">
            <h2>How We Share Information</h2>

            <p>
              We may disclose information when reasonably necessary to operate
              the website or conduct our business, including to service
              providers that provide hosting, communications, security,
              infrastructure, or other business services.
            </p>

            <p>
              We may also disclose information when required to do so by law,
              legal process, governmental request, or when reasonably
              necessary to protect the rights, property, or security of
              Blooming Systems, our users, or others.
            </p>

            <p>
              We do not sell personal information submitted through this
              website.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="security">
            <h2>Data Security</h2>

            <p>
              We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational
              measures designed to protect information against unauthorized
              access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.
            </p>

            <p>
              No method of transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be
              completely secure. Accordingly, we cannot guarantee absolute
              security of information transmitted through the internet.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="retention">
            <h2>Data Retention</h2>

            <p>
              We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary for
              the purposes for which it was collected, including responding to
              inquiries, maintaining business records, resolving disputes,
              enforcing agreements, and satisfying applicable legal or
              regulatory requirements.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="third-party">
            <h2>Third-Party Services and Links</h2>

            <p>
              The website may contain links to websites or services operated
              by third parties. Blooming Systems is not responsible for the
              privacy practices, content, or security of third-party websites.
              We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any external
              services you visit.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="rights">
            <h2>Your Privacy Rights</h2>

            <p>
              Depending on where you reside and applicable law, you may have
              rights concerning personal information, which can include the
              right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of
              certain information.
            </p>

            <p>
              To make a privacy-related request, contact us using the
              information provided below. We may need to verify your identity
              before completing certain requests.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="california">
            <h2>California Privacy Rights</h2>

            <p>
              California residents may have additional privacy rights under
              applicable California privacy laws. The availability and scope
              of those rights depend on the circumstances and applicable
              statutory requirements.
            </p>

            <p>
              California residents who have questions or wish to submit a
              privacy request may contact Blooming Systems using the contact
              information below.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="children">
            <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

            <p>
              This website is intended for business and professional use. We
              do not knowingly solicit personal information from children
              through the website.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="changes">
            <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

            <p>
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect
              changes in our website, services, business practices, or
              applicable legal requirements. The updated version will be
              posted on this page with a revised effective date.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
              If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to make
              a privacy-related request, please contact:
            </p>

            <address>
              <strong>Blooming Systems Inc.</strong><br />
              21951 Purebred Lane<br />
              Escondido, CA 92029<br />
              <a href="tel:+18587407673">858 740 7673</a>
            </address>

            <a class="legal-button" href="/contact/">
              Contact Blooming Systems
              <span>↗</span>
            </a>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 145px 0 105px;
    background: #eef4ff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-container {
    width: min(900px, calc(100% - (var(--gutter) * 2)));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .effective-date {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-content {
    padding: 110px 0 140px;
  }

  .legal-layout {
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - (var(--gutter) * 2)));
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 90px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .legal-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 110px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .legal-nav span {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .legal-nav a {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .legal-body section {
    margin-bottom: 70px;
    scroll-margin-top: 110px;
  }

  .legal-body section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .legal-body h3 {
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .legal-body p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .legal-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-body strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: 9px;
    padding-left: 5px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-body address {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 25px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-body address a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-body address a:hover {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .legal-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    background: var(--color-blue);
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 650;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background 160ms ease,
      transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .legal-button:hover {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .legal-button span {
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .legal-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 55px;
    }

    .legal-nav {
      position: static;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px 25px;
      padding-bottom: 35px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .legal-nav span {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 90px 0 75px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      padding: 75px 0 90px;
    }

    .legal-body section {
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .legal-body h2 {
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .legal-nav {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .legal-nav span {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
  .section-eyebrow{
    font-size: 15px;
  }
</style>